# Golden negotiation trace fixtures are byte-stable regression references.
# Pin to LF so they are identical on every platform and are never rewritten by a
# contributor's local core.autocrlf setting (which would otherwise dirty the
# working tree and churn the committed blob on Windows, where the trace is
# generated with CRLF). The byte-golden test reads via universal newlines, so
# this affects only the on-disk/committed form, never the PASS/FAIL verdict.
*.jsonl text eol=lf
